From f57b3266cc34f94fd650155cd09c62cba92cc0e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:59:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): one armed/idle style for every Pick button

Add pick_button / pick_widget in egui_app/pick_button.rs: the armed pick
carries the selection fill and a stroke, an idle pick a faint tint.
Boundary, setup, WCS, locate and tool-body pick buttons use it. No
behaviour or command change.

Fixes #1728

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
